OfSimRust
==========

OfSimRust (CLI binary: ofsim) is an unofficial Rust port of the OpenFront game simulation
(https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO).

It is not affiliated with, authorized by or endorsed by OpenFront Inc. or the
OpenFront project (AGPL-3.0 Section 7(c)).

