Modifications (AGPL-3.0 Section 5(a))
-------------------------------------

The files under Crates/OpenFrontEngine are modified (translated to Rust)
versions of files of OpenFrontIO src/core. Each such file names its upstream
source path in the header of the file. This paragraph and those headers are the
notice that the files were modified. Other crates are original work or
describe upstream data formats (game records and map resources).

Not included
------------

This repository contains no OpenFront map files, assets or proprietary content
(upstream /resources is CC BY-SA 4.0 with further third-party terms,
/proprietary is All Rights Reserved) and no game records or player names.

